menu "NoiseBot inter-MCU SPI transport"

    config NB_INTER_MCU_SPI_ENABLED
        bool "Enable dual-MCU SPI transport on Waveshare main"
        default n
        help
            Keep disabled until the N32R16V board variant is confirmed in
            bench, the Freenove legacy peripherals are rewired, and GPIO
            1/2/14/41/42 on the head are proven high impedance.

    config NB_DM1_BENCH_PROFILE
        bool "Boot main as minimal DM1 bench firmware"
        depends on NB_INTER_MCU_SPI_ENABLED
        default n
        help
            Bypass the legacy monolithic boot and initialize only the
            inter-MCU link task. Use only with the isolated build-dm1 profile.

    config NB_DM1_HEAD_RESET_PROBE
        bool "Run one-shot HEAD_RESET bench probe"
        depends on NB_DM1_BENCH_PROFILE
        default n
        help
            After the link reaches READY, pulse HEAD_RESET once and immediately
            request a second reset to validate the 10-second rate limit. Enable
            only in the isolated build-e6 profile with GPIO8 wired to head EN.

endmenu
